From 8e2619c8181d5412ab195b8134e0c54f336a6b5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:02:33 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Cleanup: platform-filtered candidate paths, one message path,
 drop digest, aliases, dead code (review items 10-18)

- validate_possible_paths(): Windows tests only the UNC candidates, other
  platforms only the POSIX mounts
- raad_inform(): packageStartupMessage() while .onLoad runs (option
  raadfiles.loading), message() otherwise; option raadfiles.quiet silences.
  Removes the env0/message1/message2 deferral in zzz.R
- local_filedb_copies(): key copies by the sanitised source path instead of
  an md5 (digest dropped from Imports); prune copies whose key is not in the
  current root set
- suffixed names fraser_fastice_files, iceclim_{south,north}_leads_files,
  amps_d{1,2}_files with the old names kept as aliases
- ~200 lines of commented-out code removed across 13 files (the seapodym
  error log, the pre-2021 loader, old patterns); inst/notes -> notes/
  (.Rbuildignore); @importFrom consolidated in raadfiles-package.R; README
  rewritten; Rd regenerated (roxygen2 7.3.1 here, re-run with 8.1.0 for the
  NAMESPACE formatting)
- tests for the quiet option, copy pruning, aliases and platform filtering

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RQTfEgZaDoTNgr6EBeXoX2
